OL,3,GNEWSAMet Office yellow warning in place
OL,4,Aas snow could disrupt Tuesday morning
OL,5,Atravel
OL,6,
OL,7,FParts of northern England and southern
OL,8,FScotland are getting an early taste of
OL,9,Fwinter with snow falling over some
OL,10,Fhills on Tuesday morning.
OL,12,FA Met Office yellow warning for snow is
OL,13,Fvalid until 11:00 GMT with 5-15cm
OL,14,Fexpected at some locations above
OL,15,F300-400m elevation.
OL,17,FMajor routes like the A74(M), A66 and
OL,18,FM62 could all have problems with
OL,19,Ftransport disruption.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
